# Orchestrator Rules

- Read `src/orchestrator/AGENTS.md` and `api_contracts.md`.
- Spawn engine via subprocess; do not embed CV logic in routes.
- Backend assigns `job_id` and `gpu_device`; return in `JobSubmitResponse`.
- Max 2 concurrent GPU workers.
- Update `docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md` API matrix when routes are implemented.
- WebSocket payloads must match `packages/contracts/schemas/telemetry.schema.json`.
